DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE

The MIT license above covers the source code of this project only. The data it
displays carries its own terms, which this license cannot and does not change:

1. Population, area, age and density figures come from Data Konsolidasi Bersih
   (DKB) published by Dinas Kependudukan dan Pencatatan Sipil Kota Tangerang
   Selatan. Those PDFs contain no open-license clause. They are used here with
   attribution and a recorded limitation, not under a grant of rights. Anyone
   reusing those figures must establish their own basis for doing so.

2. Point-of-interest counts and administrative boundaries come from
   OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open
   Database License (ODbL) 1.0. Reuse of those layers is bound by ODbL,
   including its attribution and share-alike terms:
   https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

3. The composite index, its indicator weights and its thresholds are this
   project's own construction. They are documented but not calibrated against
   business outcomes, and they are not a feasibility ruling. Reusing them is
   permitted under the MIT license above; treating them as validated advice is
   not supported by any evidence in this repository.
